# OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Editor/IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# codex-*/ is excluded here for a specific reason, not vendor preference:
# claude-*/ holds the exact evidence already cited (numbers, quotes,
# screenshots) in the published, fact-checked article, so it must never
# silently change. Nothing published yet depends on a specific byte of
# codex-*/ output, so it's treated as reproducible scratch by default.
# Remove this line if you want to commit a specific Codex run's results
# (e.g. once an article cites them the same way).
codex-blind/
codex-google/
codex-vercel/

# Local scratch, if any test output lands here by accident
*.tmp
